  "notes": "\n1. Used 'Dates_of_Hawker_Centres_Closure' as the primary source because it provides the most comprehensive list of Hawker Centres with coordinates.\n2. Filtered for sites within a 2.5km radius of Toa Payoh MRT (Latitude: 1.3327, Longitude: 103.8474) using prep.within_radius.\n3. Consolidated entries with the same name using prep.merge_same_place (max_m=None) to ensure each physical location is treated as a single entity.\n4. Removed any rows with invalid coordinates using prep.drop_stray_points.\n5. Calculated the pairwise straight-line distance matrix in meters using prep.haversine_matrix and converted it to the required sparse format.\n6. Skipped the join with 'List_of_Government_Markets_Hawker_Centres' as the naming conventions between the two datasets are inconsistent (causing excessive data loss), and the primary table is already specifically for Hawker Centres.\n",
  "prep_log": "**資料來源**\n\n- Dates of Hawker Centres Closure（catalogue data.gov.sg） <https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_bda4baa634dd1cc7a6c7cad5f19e2d68/view>，授權：待確認，取得 2026-10-24T18:50:39.060920+00:00\n- List of Government Markets Hawker Centres（catalogue data.gov.sg） <https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_68a42f09f350881996d83f9cd73ab02f/view>，授權：待確認，取得 2026-10-24T18:50:38.492921+00:00\n- Location of Speed Cameras in Singapore（catalogue data.gov.sg） <https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_983804de2bc016f53e44031d85d1ec8a/view>，授權：待確認，取得 2026-10-24T18:50:40.155620+00:00\n- Total Land Area of Singapore（catalogue data.gov.sg） <https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_f74e5ee9575e98ba439bee67e8f9b097/view>，授權：待確認，取得 2026-10-24T18:50:39.611130+00:00\n\n**前處理紀錄**\n\n| 步驟 | 前 | 後 | 說明 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 只保留距離 (1.3327, 103.8474) 2500 公尺內的資料 | 123 | 12 |  |\n| Filter within 2.5km of Toa Payoh MRT | 123 | 12 |  |\n| 合併同名的同一地點（只看名稱，座標取平均） | 12 | 12 | 合併 0 筆 |\n| Merge duplicate site names | 12 | 12 |  |\n| 移除離群座標（距中心 > 21 km） | 12 | 12 | 移除 0 筆，例：[] |\n| Drop stray points | 12 | 12 |  |",
